luding any communication concerning the March 24, 2026 contact at my reside=
nce, OSP case SP26096984, or CAD event SP26097765. 6. All communications be=
tween the Office of the Governor and the Oregon Department of Justice, the =
Department of Administrative Services, or any other state or federal agency=
 concerning me. 7. Any record reflecting that the Governor was personally i=
nformed of this matter, in any form, on any date, and any record reflecting=
