oncerning it. 8. Any record of a meeting, call, or briefing at which this m=
atter, my correspondence, or I was discussed. This includes calendar entrie=
s, meeting invitations, agendas, notes taken during or after, and any recor=
d identifying who was present. 9. Any recurring or periodic briefing docume=
nt produced for the Governor or her senior staff - daily or weekly issue su=
mmaries, constituent correspondence reports, agency issue reports, or equiv=
alent - in which I, my correspondence, the Oregon Parks and Recreation Depa=
rtment's handling of it, or the archive at oprdvolunteerabuse.org appears. =
